        "_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h3",
        "html": "Advanced, Comfortable Implant Care Led by Dr. Moezzi"
       },
       {
        "_key": "5ba47bb",
        "cls": "elementor-widget-text-editor",
        "_type": "text",
        "html": "<p class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\" data-end=\"2652\" data-start=\"2322\">Missing teeth can affect how you eat, speak, and feel every day. At Valencia Smile Expert, Dr. Neda Moezzi provides dental implant treatment in Santa Clarita for patients missing one tooth, several teeth, or a full arch. Each case is carefully planned around your oral health, bone support, bite, smile goals, and comfort needs.</p><p data-end=\"2850\" data-start=\"2659\">From your first consultation to your final restoration, our team focuses on clear communication, modern technology, and a supportive experience so you can feel confident about your treatment.</p>"
       }
      ]
