      "_type": "text",
      "html": "<p>Choosing the right implant dentist matters. Dental implants require careful planning, healthy bone support, precise placement, and a restoration that looks and feels natural. At Valencia Smile Expert, Dr. Moezzi combines digital imaging, guided implant planning, comfort-focused care, and personalized treatment options to help patients restore their smiles with confidence.</p>"
