      "children": [
       {
        "_key": "66ece08",
        "cls": "elementor-widget-mobile__width-inherit elementor-widget-heading",
        "_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h3",
        "html": "What Are <span style=\"color: #366797\">Dental Implants?</span>"
       },
       {
        "_key": "00d2da0",
        "cls": "elementor-widget-text-editor",
        "_type": "text",
        "html": "<p class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\" data-end=\"5815\" data-start=\"5597\">Dental implants are long-lasting tooth replacements designed to restore missing teeth from the root up. An implant is a small titanium post placed in the jawbone, where it supports a custom crown, bridge, or denture.</p><p data-end=\"6137\" data-start=\"5822\">Because implants are anchored in the jawbone, they can provide strong chewing support, a natural look, and better stability than many removable tooth replacement options. At Valencia Smile Expert, Dr. Moezzi will evaluate your bone support, gum health, and smile goals to recommend the right implant option for you.</p>"
       },
       {
        "_key": "d968d57",
        "cls": "elementor-widget-image",
        "_type": "image",
        "img": {
         "src": "/images/uploads/2025/07/valencia-photo-5.png",
         "width": 618,
         "height": 449,
         "cls": "attachment-large size-large wp-image-1020",
         "alt": "",
         "sizes": "(max-width: 618px) 100vw, 618px"
        }
       }
      ]
     },
     {
      "_type": "box",
      "_key": "e31b487",
      "cls": "e-con-full bg-list e-flex e-con e-child",
      "children": [
       {
        "_key": "62fe5cb",
        "cls": "elementor-position-inline-start elementor-view-default elementor-mobile-position-block-start elementor-widget-icon-box",
        "_type": "iconBox",
        "icon": {
         "svg": "svg-8d343ed6"
        },
        "titleTag": "p",
        "title": "Multiple Tooth Implants",
        "descTag": "p",
        "desc": "Implant-supported bridges can replace several missing teeth with stable, natural-looking results."
       },
       {
        "_key": "3c54237",
        "cls": "elementor-position-inline-start elementor-view-default elementor-mobile-position-block-start elementor-widget-icon-box",
        "_type": "iconBox",
