         "svg": "svg-8d343ed6"
        },
        "titleTag": "p",
        "title": "Full-Arch Implant Options",
        "descTag": "p",
        "desc": "For patients missing most or all teeth, full-arch options may restore an entire upper or lower smile."
       },
       {
        "_key": "ded29b0",
        "cls": "elementor-position-inline-start elementor-view-default elementor-mobile-position-block-start elementor-widget-icon-box",
        "_type": "iconBox",
        "icon": {
         "svg": "svg-8d343ed6"
        },
        "titleTag": "p",
        "title": "Zygomatic Implants",
        "descTag": "p",
        "desc": "A specialized option anchored in the cheekbone (zygoma), typically used for severe bone loss in the upper jaw."
       },
       {
        "_key": "5f8ee57",
        "cls": "elementor-position-inline-start elementor-view-default elementor-mobile-position-block-start elementor-widget-icon-box",
        "_type": "iconBox",
        "icon": {
         "svg": "svg-8d343ed6"
        },
        "titleTag": "p",
        "title": "Implant-Supported Dentures",
        "descTag": "p",
        "desc": "A more secure alternative to traditional removable dentures for patients missing many teeth."
       },
