      "children": [
       {
        "_key": "3767121",
        "cls": "elementor-widget-mobile__width-inherit elementor-widget-heading",
        "_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h3",
        "html": "Who Is a Good Candidate for <span style=\"color: #366797\">Dental Implants?</span>"
       },
       {
        "_key": "2a695ac",
        "cls": "elementor-widget-text-editor",
        "_type": "text",
        "html": "<p class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\" data-end=\"7848\" data-start=\"7528\">Many adults with missing teeth are candidates for dental implants, but every case needs a careful evaluation. During your consultation at Valencia Smile Expert, Dr. Moezzi will review your oral health, jawbone support, gum condition, bite, and medical history to determine the safest and most effective treatment plan.</p><p data-end=\"8001\" data-start=\"7855\">Even if you have bone loss, gum disease history, loose dentures, or failing teeth, you may still have implant options after the right preparation.</p>"
       },
       {
        "_type": "box",
        "_key": "0e70762",
        "cls": "e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child",
        "children": [
         {
          "_key": "9596136",
          "cls": "elementor-icon-list--layout-traditional elementor-list-item-link-full_width elementor-widget-icon-list",
